  "prefLabel": "Ncr 532.10 Proof of Land Conversion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 532.10 Proof of Land Conversion. Proof of land conversion shall include stumping, stump grinding, seeding to establish cover other than trees and shrubs, or erecting a fence and pasturing livestock.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5302.10), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
